  "details": "I don't think this was happening before the current open beta, not even in IK beta.\n\n1. Be in FBT and have calibration mirror enabled.\n\n2. Hit calibrate, notice that the mirror will spawn in front of you. Accept calibration.\n\n3. Turn 180 degrees in real life. Don't touch movement joysticks.\n\n4. Calibrate again. Notice that calibration mirror spawned in the old location it was in before and not in front of you.\n\n5. Repeat but after turning but before step 4 and calibrating again, move yourself forward a bit with joystick, calibration mirror will now spawn in front of you correctly.",
